  <p id="c-chenshu-028-shenmiaorong-bermao:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">世祖十三男：<persName id="c-chenshu-028-shenmiaorong-bermao:p001:m0006" ref="itp_cr4_7pm_A">沈皇后</persName>生<persName id="c-chenshu-028-shenmiaorong-bermao:p001:m0010" ref="2mj_6rl_6xs">廢帝</persName>、始興王<persName id="c-chenshu-028-shenmiaorong-bermao:p001:m0016" ref="5ye_fwj_neh_D">伯茂</persName></p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-028-shenmiaorong-bermao:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">始興王<persName id="c-chenshu-028-shenmiaorong-bermao:p002:m0003" ref="5ye_fwj_neh_D">伯茂</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-028-shenmiaorong-bermao:p002:m0006" ref="5ye_fwj_neh_D">鬱之</persName>，世祖第二子也。</p>
